              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, jatic para, m’ajengo; ng’atu m’afoya para, ma anyong’a nego cwinya i kume: aketho Tipo para i wie; ebikelo pokolembe ba Thekdhanumange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikok ungo, kadi ebiting’o dwande de ngo, kadi ebiketho dwande winjre i gengi de ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usi m’unyoc ebituro ngo, bonguthala m’udunyo yiro ebinego ngo: ebiwodho pokolembe i lemandha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebijik ungo, kadi cwinye de biai ungo, maram ebiketho ko pokolembe i ng’om; man cula bikuro cik pare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
