            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungu Yehova, ng’atu m’ucwio polo, m’urieyogi de kpee uwacu kumeni; ng’atu m’upedho ng’om kpee ku gin m’uai i ie; ng’atu m’umio yuyo ni dhanu m’i wie, man tipo ni ju m’uwotho i wie: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 49:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 2:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 13:47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an a, Yehova, alwong’i i bedopwe, man abimaku cingi, e abigwoki, man abimii ni lembariba mi dhanu, ni der mi Thekdhanumange; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi yabu wang’ abinga, mi wodho jukol woko kud i odkol, man ju m’ubedo i mudho kud i odkol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a Yehova, maeni nyinga; man dwong’ para abimio ni ng’atu mange ngo, kadok pak para de abimio ngo ni ayi gin m’acwia m’ang’ika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, gin ma kwong’a timbre kakare, man ayero pi gin ma nyen; ma fodi gikuwok ungo ayero pigi iwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwer wer ma nyen ni Yehova, man pak pare ugambre i tung’ ng’om; wun ma wuloro piny ba nam, ku gin ceke ma ni i ie, cula, ku ju m’ubedo i ie de. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wek langa kud adhurane giting’ dwandgi malu, ku pacu ma Kedar ubedo i ie; wek ju m’ubedo i Sela giwer, wek gikok ku wi gudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wek gimi dwong’ ni Yehova, man giyer pak pare i cula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova biwok woko calu jarukara; ebithubo ngiri pare calu won ali: ebiywak, eyo, ebikok ma tek; ebitimo ku kero kum judegi pare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abedo ling’ nindo dupa; abedo ling’, man acera gira: kawono abiywak calu dhaku ma moc ugoye; abigamu cwinya man abiyuyo karacelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abinyotho gudi kud ungulu gudi, man abitalu uboko migi ceke; man abidwoko kulo ni cula, man abidwono kut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abikelo abinga kud i yo ma ging’eyo ngo; abipeyogi i yo ma ging’eyo ngo; abidwoko mudho ni der i wang’gi, man abitiro ka m’ugondre. Abitimo gin maeni, man abikunogi ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubilokogi cen, jubinyayu lewic dit i wigi, gi ju ma gigeno ayi gin m’acwia m’ang’ika, ma giwacu ni ayi gin m’acwia m’atwaga kumae, Wun wu mungu mwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwinji, wun udhing’; man wunen, wun abinga, kara wunen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’a m’abinga, ma k’e jatic para ngo? kadi m’udhing’, calu jakwenda para m’aoro? ng’a m’abinga ma calu ng’atu ma wabedo ku kwiocwiny wakude, man abinga calu jatic pa Yehova? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ineno gin dupa, ento iketho cwinyi i kume ngo; ithe bedo ayaba, ento ewinjo ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyayu mutoro i Yehova, ni kum bedopwe pare, ya eyungo cik, man edwoke mi yung. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento maeni en e dhanu ma jumayu juyaku de; kagi ceke jumakugi i uwic i vur, man jupanugi i odkol: e gi mir amaci, man ng’atu moko mbe m’abodho; mir ayeki, man ng’atu moko mbe m’uwacu kumae, Dwoki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
